msgstr "Măsurarea succesului prin gradul de ocupare"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Now that they relax, you can offer extra services to make your guests feel "
"even more\n"
"            comfortable!"
msgstr ""
"Acum că s-au relaxat, le puteți oferi servicii suplimentare pentru a le "
"spori confortul!"

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Now that you have several companies or branches, you may want some of your "
"employees to access only to some of them in case they always work in some of "
"your places."
msgstr ""
"Dacă aveți mai multe companii sau sucursale, puteți limita accesul unor "
"angajați la locațiile unde lucrează."

#. module: campsite
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campsite.welcome_article_body
